{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-01-11 16:22:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE ANNOUNCES CLOSING OF $400 MILLION SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, JAN. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE, A MAJORITY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF SEMPRA (NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE), ANNOUNCED TODAY THE SUCCESSFUL COMPLETION OF ITS INAUGURAL OFFERING OF $400 MILLION AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 3.250% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2032. "WE ARE VERY PLEASED WITH THE RESULTS OF THIS INAUGURAL ISSUANCE," SAID JUSTIN BIRD, CEO OF SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE.'}